<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background:#f4f4f4; padding:20px;">
  <div style="max-width:600px; margin:auto; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:32px;">
    <h2 style="color:#e00b41;">Booking Confirmed!</h2>
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>Your booking has been confirmed. Here are the details:</p>
    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:16px 0;">
      <tr><td style="padding:8px; color:#555;">Booking ID</td><td style="padding:8px; font-weight:bold;">#{{bookingId}}</td></tr>
      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;"><td style="padding:8px; color:#555;">Hotel ID</td><td style="padding:8px; font-weight:bold;">{{hotelId}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:8px; color:#555;">Check-in</td><td style="padding:8px; font-weight:bold;">{{checkInDate}}</td></tr>
      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;"><td style="padding:8px; color:#555;">Check-out</td><td style="padding:8px; font-weight:bold;">{{checkOutDate}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:8px; color:#555;">Guests</td><td style="padding:8px; font-weight:bold;">{{totalGuests}}</td></tr>
      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;"><td style="padding:8px; color:#555;">Amount</td><td style="padding:8px; font-weight:bold;">₹{{bookingAmount}}</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="color:#555;">Thank you for choosing us. Enjoy your stay!</p>
    <p style="color:#999; font-size:12px;">If you have questions, reply to this email.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
